[0.825, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[H\r\u001b[13C\u001b[12B ☒ Ready proof \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Spec drift \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mI found a\u001b[13Gstruct vs spec drift: ExportD\u001b[43Gcument in model.rs has `export\u001b[74Gd_a\u001b[78G` and `know\u001b[90Gedge_it\u001b[98Gms`, but\u001b[107Gth\u001b[110G OpenAPI schema \u001b[128Ges \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1m`knowledg\u001b[13G` (n\u001b[18G `exported_at`). There may be\u001b[48Gothe\u001b[53G small \u001b[61Grifts. Should I fix these as I\u001b[92Gwire up h\u001b[104Glers, or leav\u001b[118G them fo\u001b[128Ga \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bseparate cleanup?\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[6GFix as we go\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mAlign\u001b[12GRust types to the spec during thi\u001b[46G sess\u001b[52Gon. Contract tests\u001b[71Gwill surface any \u001b[89Gema\u001b[93Gn\u001b[95Gng dr\u001b[101Gft.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mSeparate task\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mNote the drifts but don't fix them in S4 — they affect export/import which is out of scope anyway.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3. Type\u001b[11Gsom\u001b[15Gthing.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m─────"]
