[0.031, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m⏺ \u001b[39mUser answered Claude's questions:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[8GThe OpenAPI spec\u001b[25Gmandates RateLimit-* and Access-Control-Allow-Origin headers on\u001b[89GEVERY respons\u001b[103G. Contrac\u001b[113G conformance t\u001b[128Gsts will\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bfail without them. Shoul\u001b[31G S4 include tower middl\u001b[55Gware for \u001b[65Gate-limiting\u001b[78Gand CORS, or do you want\u001b[103Gthe contract\u001b[116Gt\u001b[118Gsts\u001b[123Go skip \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mh\u001b[8Gader valid\u001b[19Gtion\u001b[24Gfor now?\u001b[33G→ Add middleware now\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[12Gissue ex\u001b[21Gludes claims, sessions, knowledge,\u001b[56Gcon\u001b[60Gext, even\u001b[70Gs, and next-task. Bu\u001b[92Gdeliverabl\u001b[103G #4 sa\u001b[110Gs 'ready derivation must \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bbe observable through\u001b[28Gthe API.' How do you want to prove ready works? Options: (a) just GET the task and see status=ready after \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Badding/completing deps, or (b) also expose next-task which is the canonical 'what's ready?' query. → Include next-task\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· I "]
