[0.102, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bby\u001b[6Gtesting.\u001b[15GBut\u001b[19Git\u001b[22Gadds\u001b[27Ga\u001b[29Gbuild-time\u001b[40Gcodegen\u001b[48Gstep\u001b[53Gand\u001b[57Ga\u001b[59Gdependency\u001b[70Gon\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Ggenerator's\u001b[89Gquality.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mShould we fix this?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIf\u001b[6Gyou want tighter spec-bi\u001b[31Gding, the \u001b[42Gp\u001b[44Gions\u001b[49Gare:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1\u001b[6G\u001b[1mKeep as-is\u001b[22m — hand-written\u001b[32Gtypes + contrac\u001b[50Gest\u001b[55Gis a\u001b[60Greasonable a\u001b[73Gproach for this project \u001b[98Gize\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2\u001b[6G\u001b[1mAdd \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mprogenit\u001b[19Gr\u001b[22m\u001b[39m — generate r\u001b[34Gspon\u001b[39Ge/request types from the spec, replace\u001b[78Gmy\u001b[81Ghand-written\u001b[94Gones\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mDrop unused \u001b[38;2;177;185;249moas3\u001b[39m dep\u001b[27G\u001b[22m—\u001b[29Gsince\u001b[35Git's\u001b[40Gnot\u001b[44Gactually\u001b[53Gused,\u001b[59Gclean\u001b[65Git\u001b[68Gup\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 33s · done 10:07 PM\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;80;80;80m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mshould we use progenitor or openapi-generator? and how about oas3 would that be useless?\u001b[39m          "]
