[0.084, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[H\u001b[3G3\u001b[6GThe contract tests alre\u001b[30Gdy\u001b[33Gcatch drift. If a\u001b[51Gfield is missing\u001b[68Gor wrong-typ\u001b[81Gd, th\u001b[87G test fails. That's \u001b[108Ghe same guarantee\u001b[126Gcodegen\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bgives, just enforced at test time\u001b[40Ginstead\u001b[48Gof\u001b[51Gcompile\u001b[59Gtime.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4\u001b[6GIf the API grow\u001b[22G \u001b[24Gignificantly (S5 adds\u001b[46Gclaims/sess\u001b[58Gons/knowledge/c\u001b[75Gtext/\u001b[81Gven\u001b[85Gs — roughly doubling the surface), revisiting\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mopenapi-to-rust\u001b[39m at th\u001b[30Gpoint would make m\u001b[49Gre sense.\u001b[59G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mImmediate cleanup:\u001b[22G\u001b[22mremove the unused \u001b[38;2;177;185;249moas3\u001b[39m dev-d\u001b[51Gpendency\u001b[60Gsince\u001b[66Gwe're\u001b[72Gnot\u001b[76Gusing\u001b[82Git.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BWant me to remove \u001b[38;2;177;185;249moas3\u001b[39m, or would you\u001b[40Grather adopt \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mopenapi-to-rust\u001b[39m now before the surface\u001b[92Ggrows?\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCooked for 8m 31s · done 10:17 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;80;80;80m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwe should use oas3 it seems nice -"]
[0.000, "o", " and maybe openapi-to-rust ? can you give me a comparaison between that and oas3-gen (maintainer, \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255msupport, usage..)\u001b[39m                                                                                                                    \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m⏺\u001b[39m \u001b[1mExplore\u001b[22m(Compare openapi-to-rust vs oas3-gen)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mBackgrounded\u001b[19Gagent\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m (↓ to manage · ctrl+o to expand)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m⏺\u001b[39m Rese\u001b[8Grcher is \u001b[18Gig\u001b[21Gi\u001b[23Gg in — pulling commit frequency, download\u001b[65Gnumbers,\u001b[74Gmaintainer\u001b[85Gprofiles,\u001b[95Ggenerated\u001b[105Gcode\u001b[110Gpatterns,\u001b[120Gschema\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcomposition\u001b[15Ghandling,\u001b[25Gand\u001b[29Gthe\u001b[33Goas3-gen\u001b[42G↔\u001b[44Goas3\u001b[49Grelationship.\u001b[63GI'll\u001b[68Ghave\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gside-by-side\u001b[90Gcomparison\u001b[101Gonce\u001b[106Git\u001b[109Greports\u001b[117Gback.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GWaiting for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m background agent to finish\u001b[44G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m"]
