[0.000, "o", "things favor openapi-to-rust for this project:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1m[type_mappings]\u001b[22m\u001b[39m — You can map \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\"DateTime\" = \"chrono::DateTime<chrono::Utc>\"\u001b[39m and potentially map some schemas to\u001b[117G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mshepherd_core\u001b[39m types\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bdirectly. oas3-gen has an open issue\u001b[43G(#78) for thi\u001b[58Gbut no implementation.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mRFC 9457 request validation built-in\u001b[43G\u001b[22m—\u001b[45Gopenapi-to-rust\u001b[61Gvalidates\u001b[71Grequest\u001b[79Gbodies\u001b[86Gagainst\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98GJSON\u001b[103GSchema\u001b[110G\u001b[3mbefore\u001b[117G\u001b[23myour\u001b[122Ghandler\u001b[130Gruns,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gand returns \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mapplication/problem+json\u001b[39m errors. That's exactly what sh\u001b[74Gphe\u001b[78Gd's spec requires. With oas3-gen, we'd keep our\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bhand-written\u001b[19G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAppError\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3. \u001b[1mNo runtime crate\u001b[22m — The generated\u001b[39Gcode\u001b[44Gis\u001b[47Gself-contained.\u001b[63Goas3-gen\u001b[72Grequires\u001b[81Gadding\u001b[88G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249moas3-gen-support\u001b[105G\u001b[39mas\u001b[1"]
