[0.000, "o", ";185;249moas3\u001b[39m crate relationship is the key insight.\u001b[51G\u001b[22mIf\u001b[54Gyou\u001b[58Guse\u001b[62Gopenapi-to-rust,\u001b[79Gyou\u001b[83Gdon't\u001b[89Gneed\u001b[94G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249moas3\u001b[99G\u001b[39mat\u001b[102Gall\u001b[106G—\u001b[108Git\u001b[111Ghas\u001b[115Gits\u001b[119Gown\u001b[123Gparser.\u001b[131GIf\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Byou use oas3-gen, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249moas3\u001b[39m comes as a transitive dependency.\u001b[60GSo\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67Gchoice\u001b[74Gbetween\u001b[82Gtools\u001b[88Gdetermines\u001b[99Gwhether\u001b[107G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249moas3\u001b[112G\u001b[39mis\u001b[115Gin\u001b[118Gthe\u001b[122Gpicture.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mThree things favor openapi-to-rust for this project:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1m[type_mappings]\u001b[22m\u001b[39m — You can map \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\"DateTime\" = \"chrono::DateTime<chrono::Utc>\"\u001b[39m and potentially map some schemas to\u001b[117G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mshepherd_core\u001b[39m types\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bdirectly. oas3-gen has an open issue\u001b[43G(#78) for thi\u001b[58Gbut no implementation.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mRFC 9457 request validation built-in\u001b[43G\u001b[22m—\u001b[45Gopenapi-to-\u001b[82Gies\u001b[86Gagainst\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98GJSON\u001b[103GSch"]
