[0.382, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[H\r\u001b[15B←  ☒ PR strategy \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Router merge \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mop\u001b[6Gnapi-to-rust\u001b[19Ggenerates its own Router via build_rout\u001b[59Gr(). Our curre\u001b[75G router \u001b[84Glso serves /health, /api/v1/openap\u001b[119G.y\u001b[122Gml, \u001b[127Gnd the UI\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1Ba\u001b[7Gback.\u001b[13GShould th\u001b[23G generated router be the primary router with our extras merged in, or should we nest the generated router under \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1m/api/v1?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mGenerated as primary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mUse build_router() as the base, then add /health, /openapi.yaml, and UI fallback on top. Cleaner generated code ownership.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mNest under /api/v1\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mKeep our router() as the entry point, nest the generated router under /api/v1. Our middleware layers stay on the outer router.\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[22;1H\u001b[?2026l"]
[1.200, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[H\r\u001b[15B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m← \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☒ PR strategy \u001b[39m\u001b[49m ☐ Router merge \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mTh\u001b[6G S4 PR (#31)\u001b[19Gis already pushed. Should I retrofit op\u001b[59Gnapi-to-rust i\u001b[75Go that s\u001b[84Gme PR (amend/force-push), or make \u001b[119Gt \u001b[122G sep\u001b[127Grate \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mo\u001b[7Gow-up\u001b[13GPR on a n\u001b[23Gw branch?\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;78;186;101mSame PR (amend)\u001b[22G✔\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mUpdate the S4 branch in place. One PR with both the hand-written code replaced by generated code. Cleaner history.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mFollow-up PR\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMerge S4 as-is, then open a new PR that replaces hand-written types with openapi-to-rust generated code. Easier to review the \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bdiff.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[21;1H\u001b[?2026l"]
[1.106, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[H\r\u001b[20B \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[6GFollow-up PR\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[23;1H\u001b[?2026l"]
